Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:23:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Parity harness reachable and bounded: master.py --parity
 F0|all --parity-limit N runs S0/S1/S2 then the harness and exits.
 parity_check ABORTS if no injected frame is supplied rather than falling back
 to engine.load_sealed_baseline (hardcodes equiDOT_recon171_step7_* and would
 test a different dataset); the limit is applied to BOTH legs from one value;
 the chunked leg honours --workers while the serial reference stays
 single-process by definition; F0 reports COLLATION DEDUP VERIFIED as its own
 line; parity runs at proof scope so pre-flight completes in minutes.
 QUICK_START gains a numbered pre-flight step.

---
